      "label": "campaign_promotion",
      "description": "A scene depicting Barack Obama in a campaign setting, smiling broadly while text overlays promote a fictional policy of 'free kfc, grape kool aid, & watermelon' as a political incentive to 'vote for me'. The scene combines the visual of a political figure with satirical, racially coded text to create a meme.",
