      "instance_name": "barack_obama",
      "label": "Barack Obama",
      "description": "The 44th President of the United States, elected in 2008 and re-elected in 2012. His campaign and presidency were historic, representing the first African American president. The meme uses his image to invoke racial stereotypes, which is contextually significant.",
